# [[.DisplayName]] for iOS

Compact SwiftUI app with MVVM, a repository boundary, Swift Package Manager,
and XCTest.

```bash
swift test
swift run
```

`swift run` launches the macOS SwiftUI host supplied by this package. SwiftPM
can compile and test the shared code, but it does not create a signed iOS app,
asset catalog, simulator scheme, or archive. For device/simulator distribution,
open `Package.swift` in Xcode and embed `AppFeature` in an Xcode iOS app target
with bundle identifier `[[.Org]].[[.Package]]`.

API base: `[[.APIURL]]`
